@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
title SEQ-006 — POI revisions, review, publish, soft delete and restore
footer APPROVED D-016 DEC-076 | UC-012, UC-015, UC-016, UC-017, UC-018

actor "Staff / Manager" as Person
participant "POI & Content" as POI
participant "Identity & Staff" as Identity
database "POI DB" as DB
participant "Cloudinary" as Media
Person -> POI: Mutation + expectedEditVersion
POI -> Identity: Current role/account/open session
Identity --> POI: Context / deny
alt Authorized and matching version
 POI -> DB: Validate one draft and published immutability
 alt Draft edit
  POI -> DB: Save draft; invalidate changed dependencies
 else Review / submit
  POI -> DB: Review exact versions / in_review lock
 else Manager publish
  POI -> Media: Verify referenced assets
  Media --> POI: Metadata / failure
  POI -> DB: Check 16 approved current contents + entrance
  POI -> DB: Transaction: pointer + outbox + idempotency outcome
 else Manager delete / restore
  POI -> DB: Soft delete or restore as draft + audit outbox
 end
 POI --> Person: Outcome and current version
else Stale / wrong state / incomplete media / denied
 POI --> Person: 409 / 422 / 403 / dependency error
end
note over POI,DB: No hard delete, no cross-service DB access

@enduml
